{"title":"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/4081a599cf6570a3bdf24c89b9c4fbf79bd51f6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74982.1035$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" /> the value of the <i>place</i> occupied by the digit 9 is how many times as great as the value of the <i>place</i> occupied by the digit 3?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f8753e0798ee304d3ae572657187b78689be1d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1,000 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10,000 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 100,000 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1,000,000 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 10,000,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"614\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> places to the left of the digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, it has a place value that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/0644d687ce11b4321bbdbc28eca4a04f088bdc48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^5 = 100,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" /> times greater.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />s place.  The digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/6/d66aef8e879a5ef4d466264feaecf4737683e0de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" />ths place.  The ratio of these two numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5064444db5c6265f9a249b5e20358c57d9ddf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{\\frac{1}{1000}} = 100\\times1000 = 100,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"230\" height=\"44\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME\" title=\"1997 AJHSME\">1997 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b